WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:05,140
It's over, it's over

2
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:06,140
I am a first-class vehicle

3
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,140
The wheel is stuck

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,140
Does anyone have a fire energy stone?

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,140
My car stalled for too long

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,140
I can't start the fire. Help.

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,140
Is any good Samaritan immune?

8
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,140
Everyone is a survivor

9
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,140
Don't keep it private

10
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,140
Let’s get through the cold wave together

11
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,140
Fortunately, I opened the box before

12
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,140
Saved a pair of snow boots

13
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,140
But the temperature is too ridiculous

14
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,140
I have no feeling in my toes

15
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,140
Heavy gold ball thermal equipment

16
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:29,140
The cold wave is coming

17
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,140
It's so cold outside

18
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,300
Just in time to take a hot water bath
